<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Lost Pets - Waffy</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/lost.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
</head>
<body>

    <div class="top-note">
        💚 Be the reason a family smiles again.
        Return a lost pet to its owner and receive a special gift voucher as a thank you.
    </div>

    <div class="top-hero-area">
        <div class="top-hero-shell">
            <header class="topbar">
                <div class="header-shell">
                    <nav class="navbar">

                        <div class="left-nav desktop-nav desktop-links">
                            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Home_After" class="nav-link active">Home</a>
                            <a asp-controller="Clinic" asp-action="Clinics" class="nav-link">Clinics</a>
                            <a asp-controller="Product" asp-action="Stores" class="nav-link">Stores</a>
                            <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Adapt" class="nav-link">Adoption</a>
                            <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Lost" class="nav-link">Lost Pets</a>

                        </div>

                        <div class="logo-center">
                            <img src="../Images/logo.png" alt="Waffy Main Logo" class="main-logo">
                        </div>

                        <div class="right-nav">
                            <div class="desktop-nav desktop-links desktop-right-links">



                                <div class="services-dropdown" id="servicesDropdown">
                                    <button class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" id="servicesToggle" type="button">
                                        Services
                                        <span class="dropdown-arrow">▼</span>
                                    </button>

                                    <div class="dropdown-menu" id="servicesMenu">
                                        <a asp-controller="Clinic" asp-action="Clinics" class="dropdown-link">Clinics</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Product" asp-action="Stores" class="dropdown-link">Stores</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Adapt" class="dropdown-link">Adoption</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Lost" class="dropdown-link">Lost Pets</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Map" asp-action="Gps" class="dropdown-link">Map</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Payment" asp-action="Donate" class="dropdown-link">Donations</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Travel" class="dropdown-link">Law</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Map" asp-action="Dangerous" class="dropdown-link">Dangerous Animal</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Suport" class="dropdown-link">Technical Support</a>
                                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Faq" class="dropdown-link">FAQ</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="About" class="nav-link">About Us</a>

                            </div>

                            <div class="nav-actions">
                                <a asp-controller="Payment" asp-action="Cart" class="nav-icon" aria-label="Cart">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>
                                </a>

                                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Notifications" class="nav-icon" aria-label="Notifications">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i>
                                </a>

                                <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Profile" class="profile-btn" aria-label="Profile">
                                    <img src="../Images/user.jpg" alt="Profile">
                                </a>
                                <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" class="nav-link login-btn">Log out</a>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mobile-nav-wrap">
                                <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" type="button" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>

                                <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                                    <div class="mobile-menu-logo">
                                        <img src="../Images/logo.png" alt="Waffy Logo">
                                    </div>

                                    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Home_After" class="nav-link active">Home</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Clinic" asp-action="Clinics" class="nav-link">Clinics</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Product" asp-action="Stores" class="nav-link">Stores</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Adapt" class="nav-link">Adoption</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Pet" asp-action="Lost" class="nav-link">Lost Pets</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Map" asp-action="Gps" class="nav-link">Map</a>

                                    <div class="mobile-services-block" id="mobileServicesBlock">
                                        <button class="mobile-services-toggle" id="mobileServicesToggle" type="button">
                                            <span>Services</span>
                                            <span class="dropdown-arrow">▼</span>
                                        </button>

                                        <div class="mobile-services-menu" id="mobileServicesMenu">

                                            <a asp-controller="Payment" asp-action="Donate" class="dropdown-link">Donations</a>
                                            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Travel" class="dropdown-link">Law</a>
                                            <a asp-controller="Map" asp-action="Dangerous" class="dropdown-link">Dangerous Animal</a>
                                            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Suport" class="dropdown-link">Technical Support</a>
                                            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Fag" class="dropdown-link">FAQ</a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="About" class="nav-link">About Us</a>
                                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" class="nav-link login-btn">Log out</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </nav>
                </div>
            </header>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="container lost-page">

        <section class="hero-section fade-up">
            <h1>Lost Pets</h1>
            <p>
                Be the reason a family smiles again.<br>
                Return a lost pet to its owner and receive a special gift voucher as a thank you.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="steps-grid fade-up">
            <article class="step-card">
                <img src="../Images/lost/rep.png" alt="Report">
                <h3>Report</h3>
                <p>Share the lost pet details and location.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="step-card">
                <img src="../Images/lost/ret.png" alt="Return">
                <h3>Return Safely</h3>
                <p>Help connect the pet with its owner.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="step-card">
                <img src="../Images/lost/ver.png" alt="Verify">
                <h3>Verify</h3>
                <p>Owner confirms the pet is returned.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="step-card">
                <img src="../Images/lost/rew.png" alt="Reward">
                <h3>Reward</h3>
                <p>Receive a special thank-you voucher.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="community-section fade-up">
            <div class="community-header">
                <h2>🐾 Community Pet Heroes</h2>
                <p>People who helped return lost pets to their families</p>
                <span class="sub-ar">Thank you to all the people who contributed to bringing the pets back to their homes.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="heroes-row">
                <article class="hero-mini">
                    <img src="../Images/lost/omar.png" alt="Omar">
                    <h4>Omar</h4>
                    <span>3 Successes</span>
                </article>

                <article class="hero-mini">
                    <img src="../Images/lost/ahmad.png" alt="Ahmad">
                    <h4>Ahmad</h4>
                    <span>7 Successes</span>
                </article>

                <article class="hero-mini">
                    <img src="../Images/lost/yara.png" alt="Yara">
                    <h4>Yara</h4>
                    <span>1 Success</span>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>






<section class="pets-grid fade-up" id="petsGrid">

    @if (!Model.Reports.Any())
    {
        <div style="grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:3rem;color:#6b7c5a">
            <p>No lost pets reported currently.</p>
        </div>
    }

    @foreach (var r in Model.Reports)
    {
        <article class="pet-card" data-pet-id="@r.Id">
            <div class="pet-top">
                <img src="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.Image)
                            ? "/Images/lost/Beagle.png"
                            : r.Image)"
                     alt="@r.Name">
                <div class="pet-info">
                    <div class="pet-head">
                        <h3>@r.Name</h3>
                        <button class="status-btn"
                                data-open-flow="@r.Id">
                            I found it
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.Breed))   { <p>@r.Breed</p> }
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.Color))   { <p>@r.Color</p> }
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.DateLost)){ <p>Lost: @r.DateLost</p> }
                    @if (r.Reward > 0) { <p>🎁 Reward: @r.Reward JOD</p> }
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pet-location">
                📍 @r.Area@(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.Area) && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.City) ? ", " : "")@r.City
            </div>
            <div class="pet-phone">Code: @r.ReportCode</div>
        </article>
    }

</section>

@* Pagination *@
<div class="more-wrap fade-up">
    @if (Model.HasPreviousPage)
    {
        <a asp-controller="Pet"
           asp-action="Lost"
           asp-route-page="@(Model.CurrentPage - 1)"
           class="more-btn">← Previous</a>
    }

    <span style="font-weight:700;color:#5a8f38">
        Page @Model.CurrentPage of @Model.TotalPages
    </span>

    @if (Model.HasNextPage)
    {
        <a asp-controller="Pet"
           asp-action="Lost"
           asp-route-page="@(Model.CurrentPage + 1)"
           class="more-btn">Next →</a>
    }
</div>















    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
            <span>|</span>
            <a href="about.html">Contact</a>
            <span>|</span>
            <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
            <span>|</span>
            <div class="social-inline">
                <span>f</span>
                <span>🐦</span>
                <span>◎</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>© 2026 Waffy, all rights reserved.</div>
    </footer>


    <div id="flowModal" class="flow-modal hidden">
        <div class="flow-overlay" data-close-flow></div>

        <div class="flow-card">
            <button class="flow-close" data-close-flow>&times;</button>

            <section class="flow-step active" data-step="1">
                <div class="modal-head">
                    <h2>Finder Verification Form</h2>
                    <p>Please enter your real information to continue.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="secret-box">
                    <div class="question-card" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
                        ⚠️ Please fill in your real name and the same phone number you will use to contact the pet owner.
                        <br><br>
                        The reward or coupon will only be delivered if the phone number entered here matches the number used to contact the pet owner.
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-grid one">
                        <label>
                            <span>Full Name</span>
                            <input id="finderName" type="text" placeholder="Enter your full name" />
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-grid phone-grid">
                        <label>
                            <span>Country</span>
                            <select id="countryCode">
                                <option value="+962">Jordan (+962)</option>
                                <option value="+966">Saudi Arabia (+966)</option>
                                <option value="+971">UAE (+971)</option>
                                <option value="+20">Egypt (+20)</option>
                                <option value="+970">Palestine (+970)</option>
                                <option value="+961">Lebanon (+961)</option>
                            </select>
                        </label>

                        <label>
                            <span>Phone Number</span>
                            <input id="finderPhone" type="text" placeholder="7X XXX XXXX" />
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-grid one">
                        <label class="answer-label">
                            <span>Secret Question</span>
                            <div class="question-card">
                                Is there any unique mark or special feature you can describe?
                            </div>
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-grid one">
                        <label class="answer-label">
                            <span>Your Answer</span>
                            <input id="secretAnswer" type="text" placeholder="Enter your answer here." />
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <small>
                        You must answer the secret question correctly so Waffy can verify that your information is valid before approving the reward.
                    </small>
                </div>

                <div class="step-actions">
                    <button class="step-btn" id="verifyFinderInfoBtn" type="button" onclick="goToVerificationStep()">Submit for Verification</button>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="flow-step" data-step="2">
                <div class="modal-head">
                    <h2>Found Animal Information</h2>
                    <p>Found Animal Information</p>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid one">
                    <label>
                        <span>Animal Photo</span>
                        <input id="animalPhoto" type="file" accept="image/png, image/jpeg, image/jpg" />
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid two">
                    <label>
                        <span>Animal Type</span>
                        <select id="animalType">
                            <option value="">Select type</option>
                            <option>Dog</option>
                            <option>Cat</option>
                            <option>Bird</option>
                            <option>Rabbit</option>
                            <option>Other</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <span>Color / Markings</span>
                        <input id="animalColor" type="text" placeholder="Example: red fur with white spot..." />
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid two">
                    <label>
                        <span>Date Found</span>
                        <input id="dateFound" type="date" />
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <span>Time Found (Optional)</span>
                        <input id="timeFound" type="time" />
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid one">
                    <label>
                        <span>Location Found</span>
                        <div id="map"></div>
                        <small class="map-note">Click on the map to select the location.</small>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid one">
                    <label>
                        <span>Address</span>
                        <input id="addressFound" type="text" placeholder="Enter the address, street, area, city..." />
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="form-grid one">
                    <label>
                        <span>Description</span>
                        <textarea id="animalDescription" placeholder="Example: Brown husky, calm, found near Al-Hussein park..."></textarea>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="step-actions two-btns">
                    <button class="back-btn" data-prev-step="1">Back</button>
                    <button class="step-btn" data-next-step="3">Submit</button>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="flow-step" data-step="3">
                <div class="result-box">
                    <div class="result-icon">⏳</div>
                    <h2>We Received Your Report!</h2>
                    <p>
                        Your report has been sent successfully.<br>
                        We will review the photo and contact you soon.
                    </p>

                    <div class="score-box">
                        <div class="score-line">
                            <span>Type</span>
                            <div class="score-bar"><i style="width:100%"></i></div>
                            <strong>100%</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="score-line">
                            <span>Location</span>
                            <div class="score-bar"><i style="width:78%"></i></div>
                            <strong>78%</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="score-line">
                            <span>Color</span>
                            <div class="score-bar orange"><i style="width:65%"></i></div>
                            <strong>65%</strong>
                        </div>

                        <div class="total-score">
                            <div class="big-score">81%</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Overall Match Score</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timer-box">
                        <span>Auto-expires in</span>
                        <strong id="countdownText">47:51:48</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="note-box">
                        SMS notice will be sent if the owner confirms the match.
                    </div>

                    <div class="verify-box">
                        <p>✅ The pet owner has reviewed the report — the next step is to answer the secret question.</p>
                        <button class="step-btn" data-next-step="4" type="button">Continue to Secret Verification</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="flow-step" data-step="4">
                <div class="result-box">
                    <div class="result-icon">🔎</div>
                    <h2>Waffy Team Verification</h2>
                    <p>
                        Your information has been submitted successfully.<br>
                        The Waffy team will now verify the details you entered and review your secret answer.
                    </p>

                    <div class="note-box">
                        Please make sure you contact the pet owner using the same phone number you entered in this form.
                    </div>

                    <div class="verify-box">
                        <p>
                            ✅ Once the information is confirmed and the phone number matches the one used to contact the pet owner,
                            your reward or coupon will be sent to you.
                        </p>
                        <button class="step-btn" data-next-step="5" type="button">Continue</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="flow-step" data-step="5">
                <div class="success-final">
                    <div class="success-icon">🎁</div>
                    <h2>Verification in Progress</h2>
                    <p>
                        Thank you for helping return the pet.<br>
                        The Waffy team is now checking the information you submitted.
                    </p>

                    <div class="wallet-card">
                        <div class="wallet-amount">Pending</div>
                        <div class="wallet-status">
                            <strong>Reward / Coupon Under Review</strong>
                            <span>It will be sent after successful verification</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="transaction-card">
                        <p><strong>Status:</strong> Waiting for Waffy team verification</p>
                        <p><strong>Phone Match Required:</strong> Yes</p>
                        <p><strong>Secret Answer Review:</strong> In progress</p>
                        <p><strong>Reward Delivery:</strong> After confirmation only</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="note-box">
                        The reward or coupon will not be delivered unless the number entered in this form matches the number used to contact the pet owner.
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-actions">
                        <button class="step-btn" id="reportAnotherAnimal" type="button">Done</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="abuseModal" class="flow-modal hidden">
        <div class="flow-overlay" data-close-abuse></div>
        <div class="abuse-card">
            <button class="flow-close" data-close-abuse>&times;</button>

            <h3>Report Abuse</h3>
            <p>If the owner did not return the pet or used the process incorrectly, you can report it here.</p>

            <label>
                <span>Fraud Type</span>
                <select id="fraudType">
                    <option>False report or mismatch</option>
                    <option>Owner denied after return</option>
                    <option>Wrong code / fake code</option>
                    <option>Other</option>
                </select>
            </label>

            <label>
                <span>Details</span>
                <textarea id="fraudDetails" placeholder="Explain what happened."></textarea>
            </label>

            <div class="step-actions two-btns">
                <button class="back-btn" data-close-abuse>Cancel</button>
                <button class="step-btn" id="submitAbuseBtn" type="button">Send Report</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>
    
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/lost.js"></script>
</body>
</html>